  "description": "Transparent Read/Write (Master/Replica) database splitting for EF Core 8+. Routes HTTP GET requests to a read replica and writes to the master, with [UseReadDb]/[UseWriteDb] attributes for explicit control and an HttpContext-free scope API for background workers, Hangfire and Quartz. Provider agnostic: SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL and others.",
